{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\136.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "7.4.1PropertiesofEaurality", "conf": 0.863, "box": [[70, 72], [604, 69], [604, 109], [70, 111]]}, {"text": "Before solving equations, let's learn about some important properties of equality.", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[65, 120], [1373, 88], [1375, 142], [66, 174]]}, {"text": " If the same number is added to both sides of an equation, the equation still remains", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[76, 176], [1472, 142], [1473, 195], [77, 230]]}, {"text": "equal.", "conf": 0.755, "box": [[109, 235], [212, 235], [212, 277], [109, 277]]}, {"text": " If the same number is subtracted from both sides of an equation, the equation still", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[88, 288], [1446, 257], [1447, 307], [89, 338]]}, {"text": "remains equal.", "conf": 0.84, "box": [[111, 346], [342, 346], [342, 387], [111, 387]]}, {"text": " If both sides of an equation are multiplied by the same number, the equation still", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[88, 401], [1425, 374], [1426, 423], [89, 450]]}, {"text": "remains equal.", "conf": 0.856, "box": [[108, 458], [342, 458], [342, 498], [108, 498]]}, {"text": " If both sides of an equation are divided by the same non-zero number, the equation still", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[89, 514], [1543, 489], [1544, 535], [90, 560]]}, {"text": "remains equal.", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[110, 571], [340, 571], [340, 611], [110, 611]]}, {"text": "To check if our solution is correct, put the value of the variable in the original equation. If", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[64, 627], [1503, 607], [1504, 650], [65, 671]]}, {"text": "the answer of the left hand side is equal to the right hand side, our solution is correct.", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[65, 681], [1450, 666], [1451, 710], [65, 724]]}, {"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.823, "box": [[67, 741], [253, 740], [254, 778], [67, 779]]}, {"text": "Khadija is thrice as old as her daughter.The sum of their ages", "conf": 0.877, "box": [[68, 789], [1130, 783], [1130, 820], [68, 827]]}, {"text": "is 48. Find her daughter's age.", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[66, 841], [574, 847], [574, 883], [66, 878]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.848, "box": [[68, 900], [221, 900], [221, 934], [68, 934]]}, {"text": "Suppose thepresent ageofKhadija's daughter=xyears", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[66, 941], [977, 944], [977, 980], [66, 977]]}, {"text": "As she is thriceas old as her daughterthen,", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[68, 995], [761, 1002], [761, 1038], [68, 1032]]}, {"text": "Khadija's present age = 3x", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[66, 1055], [485, 1059], [485, 1096], [66, 1092]]}, {"text": "According to the given condition:", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[67, 1109], [602, 1114], [601, 1152], [67, 1146]]}, {"text": "Verification: Let's put the value ofx in", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[746, 1144], [1286, 1148], [1286, 1181], [746, 1178]]}, {"text": "3x + x = 48", "conf": 0.75, "box": [[68, 1159], [248, 1159], [248, 1192], [68, 1192]]}, {"text": "the original equation.", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[861, 1188], [1160, 1192], [1159, 1225], [861, 1221]]}, {"text": "4x = 48", "conf": 0.778, "box": [[68, 1205], [192, 1207], [191, 1242], [67, 1240]]}, {"text": "3×12+12=48", "conf": 0.816, "box": [[902, 1231], [1121, 1231], [1121, 1261], [902, 1261]]}, {"text": "4x-48", "conf": 0.667, "box": [[74, 1264], [230, 1264], [230, 1306], [74, 1306]]}, {"text": "36+12=48", "conf": 0.788, "box": [[919, 1270], [1102, 1272], [1101, 1304], [919, 1301]]}, {"text": "(dividing both sides by 4)", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[242, 1288], [643, 1296], [642, 1332], [241, 1325]]}, {"text": "48=48", "conf": 0.824, "box": [[976, 1309], [1096, 1312], [1095, 1346], [975, 1344]]}, {"text": "x = 12", "conf": 0.606, "box": [[67, 1346], [175, 1346], [175, 1381], [67, 1381]]}, {"text": "LH.S=R.H.S", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[919, 1353], [1102, 1356], [1101, 1386], [918, 1383]]}, {"text": "Hence,oursolutioniscorrect.", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[806, 1394], [1217, 1400], [1217, 1431], [806, 1424]]}, {"text": "So, her daughter's age is 12 years.", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[68, 1405], [606, 1417], [605, 1453], [67, 1441]]}, {"text": "Example 2:", "conf": 0.8, "box": [[67, 1457], [255, 1460], [254, 1498], [67, 1496]]}, {"text": "Verification:Let'sputthevalueof.in", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[748, 1486], [1279, 1495], [1279, 1527], [748, 1518]]}, {"text": "Solve x - 5 = 4", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[72, 1507], [308, 1511], [307, 1545], [71, 1541]]}, {"text": "the original equation.", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[863, 1529], [1158, 1536], [1157, 1570], [862, 1562]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[71, 1560], [229, 1562], [228, 1600], [70, 1597]]}, {"text": "x-5=4", "conf": 0.732, "box": [[946, 1574], [1074, 1574], [1074, 1605], [946, 1605]]}, {"text": "x-5=4", "conf": 0.811, "box": [[67, 1605], [216, 1602], [217, 1637], [68, 1639]]}, {"text": "9-5=4", "conf": 0.752, "box": [[945, 1610], [1077, 1614], [1076, 1648], [944, 1645]]}, {"text": "Add 5 to both sides.", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[75, 1645], [392, 1651], [391, 1687], [74, 1681]]}, {"text": "4=4", "conf": 0.729, "box": [[993, 1656], [1077, 1656], [1077, 1687], [993, 1687]]}, {"text": "x -/5 +/5 = 4 + 5", "conf": 0.857, "box": [[71, 1695], [343, 1699], [342, 1744], [70, 1739]]}, {"text": "LH.S=R.H.S", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[918, 1695], [1100, 1698], [1099, 1730], [917, 1726]]}, {"text": "So,oursolutioniscorrect.", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[831, 1736], [1188, 1744], [1187, 1774], [831, 1766]]}, {"text": "x= 9", "conf": 0.653, "box": [[66, 1759], [161, 1755], [163, 1793], [67, 1797]]}, {"text": "Guidethe students to visit thegiven link for practicing the conceptthrough online games:", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[206, 1803], [1428, 1830], [1427, 1867], [205, 1839]]}, {"text": "HING", "conf": 0.616, "box": [[108, 1815], [157, 1809], [159, 1831], [110, 1837]]}, {"text": "https://www.education.com/game/treasure-diving-salving-cne-step-additian-and", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[200, 1841], [1400, 1867], [1399, 1903], [199, 1877]]}, {"text": 